---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  titleOverride="Turnkey Building Contractors in Lucknow | VP Infra"
  description="VP Infra is Lucknow's trusted turnkey building contractor. We handle design, approvals, construction & finishing under one contract. Call 8840069902 today."
>
  <section class="page-header text-center" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82), rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82)), url('/images/turnkey_building_contractors_lucknow.webp');">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="fade-in-up">Turnkey Building Contractors in Lucknow</h1>
      <p class="fade-in-up mt-4">One contract. One team. Your building — from empty plot to finished keys.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-details">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid gap-8 service-grid">
        <div class="service-content fade-in-up">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Complete Turnkey Construction, Start to Finish</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">If you want your building done without managing ten different vendors, VP Infra's turnkey building contractor service in Lucknow is built for you. We take full ownership of your project from day one — design, structural work, finishing, plumbing, electrical, and final handover. You hand us your plot and requirements. We hand you the keys.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">This is what a real turnkey contract means: single-point accountability. If there is a problem with waterproofing five years after completion, you call us. Not the waterproofing subcontractor. Not the finishing team. Us. That is the commitment we make to every client before the contract is signed.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">What Our Turnkey Service Includes</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Architectural Design and Drawings:</strong> Floor plan creation, elevation design, and structural drawings by qualified engineers — all included within the scope.</li>
            <li><strong>Municipal Approval Assistance:</strong> Building permit application, LDA/LMC map submission, NOC documentation, and approval follow-up.</li>
            <li><strong>Civil and Structural Construction:</strong> Foundation, columns, beams, slab, brick masonry, plaster, and waterproofing.</li>
            <li><strong>MEP Work:</strong> Electrical wiring, plumbing, drainage, and sanitation — installed during construction, not as an afterthought.</li>
            <li><strong>Finishing and Interiors:</strong> Flooring, wall paint, false ceiling if required, doors, windows, bathroom tiling, and kitchen countertop.</li>
            <li><strong>Final Quality Inspection:</strong> Defect-free handover checklist before project closure and key handover.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Why Turnkey Makes More Sense in Lucknow</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Managing separate architects, structural engineers, civil contractors, electricians, plumbers, tile fitters, and painters is genuinely exhausting. Coordination gaps between trades are one of the biggest reasons projects get delayed in Lucknow's construction market. When you hire VP Infra as your turnkey building contractor, that coordination becomes our problem entirely.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">Our project management tracks every on-site activity. You receive WhatsApp updates with photos twice a week. Any design change goes through a formal change order with a clear cost implication — so there are no verbal agreements that create disputes later.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Projects We Handle on Turnkey Basis</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Residential Turnkey:</strong> Independent homes, builder floors, apartments, and housing layouts. See our <a href="/services/residential-construction-services-in-lucknow/">residential construction services in Lucknow</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Duplex Turnkey:</strong> Both units built simultaneously with shared infrastructure under one agreement. See our <a href="/services/duplex-construction-company-in-lucknow/">duplex construction services in Lucknow</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Commercial Turnkey:</strong> Office buildings, retail shops, showrooms, and warehouses. See our <a href="/services/commercial-construction-company-in-lucknow/">commercial construction services in Lucknow</a>.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="internal-links-section mt-8">
            <p>Related services from VP Infra:</p>
            <ul class="related-links">
              <li><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Building construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/custom-home-builders-in-ashiyana-lucknow/">Custom home builders in Ashiyana, Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/about-us/">About V.P. Infra Properties</a></li>
              <li><a href="/blog/">Construction guides and tips</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8"><a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Turnkey Project</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="service-image fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
          <img src="/images/turnkey_building_contractors_lucknow.webp" alt="Turnkey Building Contractors in Lucknow — VP Infra project manager reviewing plans on site" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Everything You Need to Know -->
  <section class="know-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="know-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Everything You Need to Know</h2>
        <p class="know-subtitle">How a turnkey contract works in Lucknow — phases, payments, warranties, and what to expect throughout.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="know-stats">
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">6</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Phases from design to keys</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">1</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Contract, zero vendor chaos</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">ISO</span><span class="know-stat-desc">9001:2015 Certified</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">5 yr</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Structural warranty</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="know-grid">
        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🏗️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Phase 1 to 3: Design to Foundation</h3>
            <p>The project starts with architectural design — floor plan, elevation, and structural drawings. This is followed by the approval phase where the building permit is filed with LDA or LMC. Most residential approvals in Lucknow take 6 to 10 weeks. Foundation work begins immediately after approval, covering excavation, PCC, footing casting, plinth beam, and backfill.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🧱</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Phase 4 to 5: Structure and Finishing</h3>
            <p>The superstructure phase covers columns, beams, floor slabs, brick masonry, lintels, and the staircase — the longest phase on any project. Finishing follows: internal and external plaster, flooring, painting, doors, windows, bathroom tiling, electrical points, and plumbing connections. VP Infra runs MEP trades concurrently to avoid sequential delays.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🔑</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Phase 6: Quality Handover</h3>
            <p>Before keys are handed over, VP Infra's quality team walks through the building with a checklist covering structural inspection, waterproofing tests, MEP functionality, door and window fit, and finishing quality. Any punch-list items are cleared first. You receive a building that is genuinely ready to occupy, not one requiring three more months of your attention.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">💳</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Payment Milestones</h3>
            <p>VP Infra uses milestone-based payment terms — typically 10% on signing, 15% on foundation, 25% on plinth, 25% on roof slab, 15% on finishing commencement, and 10% on final handover. Payments are triggered only when physical construction milestones are achieved and verified on site, not on calendar dates alone.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🏦</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Home Loans for Turnkey Projects</h3>
            <p>Banks and housing finance companies prefer turnkey contracts when processing construction loans because the single contractor provides a unified cost estimate, project schedule, and legal construction agreement — all documents required for disbursement. VP Infra's ISO certification and MSME registration also support the contractor verification that some lenders require.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card know-card-highlight">
          <div class="know-icon">🛡️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Warranty and Accountability</h3>
            <p>VP Infra provides a 5-year structural warranty on load-bearing elements and a 1-year warranty on finishing. This is written into the contract, not a verbal assurance. Post-handover support is available on call. Choosing a <a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">building construction company in Lucknow</a> with documented accountability protects your investment long after the project closes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title text-center mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What does a turnkey building contract include?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>A turnkey contract covers architectural design, structural engineering, municipal approval filing, civil construction, MEP installation, and all finishing works. The client provides the plot and requirements. The contractor delivers a move-in-ready structure against a fixed-scope agreement with milestone-based payment terms.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How is turnkey different from conventional contract construction?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>In a turnkey contract, the contractor handles everything from design to handover. In conventional contracting, the client manages separate architects, suppliers, and trade contractors. Turnkey gives you single-point accountability and a known project cost upfront. Conventional contracting requires more client involvement but may suit those who already have a design and prefer direct vendor management.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How are payments structured in a VP Infra turnkey project?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>VP Infra uses milestone-based payment terms: 10% on signing, 15% on foundation, 25% on plinth, 25% on roof slab, 15% on finishing commencement, and 10% on final handover. Payments are linked to physical construction milestones verified on site.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does the turnkey rate include furniture and interior design?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>VP Infra's standard turnkey scope includes civil finishing — flooring, plaster, paint, basic sanitary fittings, doors, windows, and electrical points. Modular kitchen, wardrobes, furniture, air conditioning, and decorative interior work are not included but can be added as a separate scope with a separate quotation. The full inclusions and exclusions list is provided in writing at the time of quotation.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Is there a warranty on VP Infra turnkey construction?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. VP Infra provides a 5-year structural warranty on load-bearing elements such as columns, beams, and slabs. Finishing defects covering paint, tiling, and plumbing fittings are covered for 1 year from handover. Both commitments are written into the construction contract.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can VP Infra handle turnkey projects in Ashiyana Colony?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. VP Infra's registered office is in Ashiyana Colony, Lucknow. They have completed turnkey projects across Ashiyana, Kanpur Road, Indira Nagar, Aliganj, and Gomti Nagar. They also offer specialised <a href="/services/custom-home-builders-in-ashiyana-lucknow/">custom home building in Ashiyana, Lucknow</a> for fully designed custom homes on client plots.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section text-center">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>One Team for Your Entire Building Project</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 mb-8">Stop coordinating multiple vendors. Let VP Infra handle your complete project as trusted turnkey building contractors in Lucknow.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Request a Turnkey Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:8840069902" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Call: 8840069902</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header { background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: var(--text-light); padding: 8rem 0 6rem; }
  .page-header h1 { color: var(--text-light); font-size: 3.5rem; }
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr; align-items: start; padding: 4rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 992px) { .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; } }
  .service-image img { width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .benefits-list { list-style: none; }
  .benefits-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-gray); }
  .benefits-list li::before { content: '🔑'; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }
  .benefits-list strong { color: var(--secondary); }
  .related-links { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .related-links li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .related-links a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .internal-links-section { border-top: 1px solid #e0e7f0; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
  .internal-links-section p { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .know-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: #f4f7fb; }
  .know-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .know-subtitle { color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .know-stats { display: flex; justify-content: center; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .know-stat { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 1.4rem 1rem; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
  .know-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .know-stat-value { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; }
  .know-stat-desc { font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); margin-top: 0.2rem; text-align: center; }
  .know-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .know-stats { flex-wrap: wrap; } .know-stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); flex: 1 1 45%; } }
  .know-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem; display: flex; gap: 1.1rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-left: 3px solid var(--primary); transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease; }
  .know-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.11); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .know-card-highlight { border-left-color: var(--secondary); background: #fffaf4; }
  .know-icon { font-size: 1.7rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
  .know-card-body h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
  .know-card-body p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.72; margin: 0; }
  .know-card-body a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .faq-section { padding: 4rem 0; background: #fff; }
  .faq-list { max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .faq-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e0e7f0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .faq-item summary { padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--primary); list-style: none; }
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-answer { padding: 0 1.5rem 1.2rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.75; }
  .cta-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
  .cta-section h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 2.2rem; }
  .cta-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-lg { padding: 1rem 2.2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .btn-secondary { background: transparent; border: 2px solid #fff; color: #fff; }
</style>
